 "describe": "step_007: save with one request, POST /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php, in place of 8 GUI steps (step_000 to step_007).\n  sign-in: the replaying browser's own session; form read again from /wp-admin/edit-tags.php?taxonomy=category\n  fields: 6 form_default, 2 param, 1 select_label, 1 session\n  run values: tag-name={name}, parent={parent}, description={description}\n  accepted when: HTTP [200]\n  record check after: 3 effect(s) copied from the save step\n  right record (subject_name): the request sends {name} in tag-name and the record check selects name = {name}\n  the form's own script runs before each save, in a scratch page with writes blocked, on the run's values: inline script, script http://127.0.0.1:9664/wp-admin/js/common.min.js?ver=6.6.2, script http://127.0.0.1:9664/wp-admin/js/inline-edit-tax.min.js?ver=6.6.2, script http://127.0.0.1:9664/wp-admin/js/svg-painter.js?ver=6.6.2, script http://127.0.0.1:9664/wp-admin/js/tags.min.js?ver=6.6.2, script http://127.0.0.1:9664/wp-admin/load-scripts.php?c=0&amp;load%5Bchunk_0%5D=hoverIntent,wp-hooks&amp;ver=6.6.2, and 9 more\n  screen-only checks, not repeated: ['step_000: region_stable', 'step_002: region_stable', 'step_004: region_stable']\n  if the form or a check differs at run time, the GUI steps run instead",
